  q('"Are your team members actively recommending retail and add-ons, or does that feel inconsistent?"'),
  q('"If you had to guess, how many clients in the last six months did not come back? What do you think happened?"'),
  listenFor("She will not know the answers to most of these. That unknowing is your case."),
  sp(0,20),

  secLabel("The self-awareness gap"),
  q('"Have you ever personally gone through your booking and intake process as if you were a new client?"'),
  q('"Do you know what your team says on the phone when you\'re not listening?"'),
  q('"Have you ever received feedback from a client who had a less-than-perfect experience? What happened?"'),
