  sp(0,20),
  say('"So what I\'m hearing is...'),
  sp(0,20),
  say('You\'ve built something you\'re genuinely proud of. You know the treatments are good. You know the clients who come regularly love you.'),
  sp(0,20),
  say('But there is a part of the business you have never actually seen. The part that happens before a new client ever sits in your chair. And after they leave.'),
  sp(0,20),
  say('And if you\'re honest, you don\'t fully know what is happening in those moments.'),
  sp(0,20),
  say('Is that close?"'),
  dir("[Let her confirm. That moment of recognition is everything.]"),
  sp(0,20),
  divider(),
  sp(0,20),
  say('"Here is what we know from working inside med spas.'),
  sp(0,20),
  say('Most of the revenue a clinic loses is invisible to the owner. It is not loud. It does not show up as a complaint. It just shows up as a client who never rebooks. A phone call that went unanswered. A consultation that ended without a plan.'),
  sp(0,20),
