  sp(0,20),

  say('"I want to show you something. We built a tool specifically for this, and I think it is going to make everything we just talked about much more concrete.'),
  sp(0,20),
  say('It takes about 20 minutes. We will run through it together using your actual numbers. And by the end, you will see exactly where your business is leaking revenue, and how much.'),
